          "span_id": "SPN-INCIDENT-002",
          "substantive": true,
          "text": "## Prerequisites and access",
          "text_digest": "553aad5b3cc0c7d88465f22608e26e66f4a7220eb407850dffd4cd14bcb3fd2d",
          "untrusted": false
        },
        {
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "ordinal": 2,
          "section_id": "SEC-INCIDENT-PRECONDITIONS",
          "source_digest": "f20457577d4b565f2a8a6e2f66ceb9f1fbe63f12fa4557dd54a8a5408d449c41",
          "span_id": "SPN-INCIDENT-003",
          "substantive": true,
          "text": "The operator needs access to Beacon Monitor, the Incident Console, and the service roster. A screenshot is referenced as the authoritative click path.",
          "text_digest": "cfe1d45ceca238d616b2e780c454342f695ec575abc55a96e7decc06b5256e42",
          "untrusted": false
        },
        {
          "block_type": "heading",
          "ordinal": 3,
          "section_id": "SEC-INCIDENT-ACTIONS",
          "source_digest": "f20457577d4b565f2a8a6e2f66ceb9f1fbe63f12fa4557dd54a8a5408d449c41",
          "span_id": "SPN-INCIDENT-004",
          "substantive": true,
          "text": "## Atomic actions",
          "text_digest": "3b80f1d96a320cfba79c02a7f72ee3e50f70c1033dfa367e68978d85cf5af5da",
          "untrusted": false
        },
        {
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "ordinal": 4,
          "section_id": "SEC-INCIDENT-ACTIONS",
          "source_digest": "f20457577d4b565f2a8a6e2f66ceb9f1fbe63f12fa4557dd54a8a5408d449c41",
          "span_id": "SPN-INCIDENT-005",
          "substantive": true,
          "text": "Open the alert, acknowledge it, and assign the incident to the on-call role. If it is customer-impacting, notify the communications lead.",
          "text_digest": "7ecfe4b5881ebd4d45439e9d0c894086c1e9c514ceeea6fa851d725790c7960a",
          "untrusted": false
        },
        {
          "block_type": "heading",
          "ordinal": 5,
          "section_id": "SEC-INCIDENT-DECISION",
          "source_digest": "f20457577d4b565f2a8a6e2f66ceb9f1fbe63f12fa4557dd54a8a5408d449c41",
          "span_id": "SPN-INCIDENT-006",
          "substantive": true,
          "text": "## Severity decision",
          "text_digest": "12f03391967f015d5c6998564a7767981b5057bcf89bb90c429cfc88d9d501c8",
          "untrusted": false
        },
        {
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "ordinal": 6,
          "section_id": "SEC-INCIDENT-DECISION",
          "source_digest": "f20457577d4b565f2a8a6e2f66ceb9f1fbe63f12fa4557dd54a8a5408d449c41",
          "span_id": "SPN-INCIDENT-007",
          "substantive": true,
          "text": "Use the service-level table to choose a fifteen-minute or one-hour response. The table does not define the customer-impacting test.",
          "text_digest": "fb0187c9facaca8b76e4e156d360bbb7c4875a0884fd05058feb5fb9aba29ce5",
          "untrusted": false
        },
        {
          "block_type": "heading",
          "ordinal": 7,
          "section_id": "SEC-INCIDENT-RECOVERY",
          "source_digest": "f20457577d4b565f2a8a6e2f66ceb9f1fbe63f12fa4557dd54a8a5408d449c41",
          "span_id": "SPN-INCIDENT-008",
          "substantive": true,
          "text": "## Failure path and rollback",
          "text_digest": "32a075b55c67e8a0ab9e8704a53bb73305734a5d6debc3ab750394d35df47835",
          "untrusted": false
        },
        {
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "ordinal": 8,
          "section_id": "SEC-INCIDENT-RECOVERY",
          "source_digest": "f20457577d4b565f2a8a6e2f66ceb9f1fbe63f12fa4557dd54a8a5408d449c41",
          "span_id": "SPN-INCIDENT-009",
          "substantive": true,
          "text": "If the console is unavailable, use the phone tree and record the incident in the offline worksheet. Restore the primary record after service returns.",
          "text_digest": "ce6e62836531d96d7a738860b9c23840f70f7e2015e463f480273b3a51b6ee45",
          "untrusted": false
        },
        {
